WEBVTT

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.208
<i>Many generations have passed</i>

00:00:27.291 --> 00:00:30.916
<i>since the light</i>
<i>of the Jedi protected the galaxy.</i>

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.125
<i>Since then, an era of war has arisen.</i>

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:39.416
<i>But Margrave Juro,</i>
<i>ruler of the planet Hy Izlan, has a plan.</i>

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:44.291
<i>He has recently begun mining for</i>
<i>rare kyber crystals within his territory.</i>

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:47.833
<i>Using these crystals,</i>
<i>he seeks to restore the Jedi</i>

00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:52.041
<i>by reforging their ancient weapons,</i>
<i>lightsabers,</i>

00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:54.875
<i>which have since been lost to the galaxy.</i>

00:00:54.958 --> 00:01:00.208
<i>However, ancient dark forces conspire</i>
<i>to subjugate the galaxy.</i>

00:01:00.291 --> 00:01:04.666
<i>They hatch their own sinister plan</i>
<i>to hunt all suspected Jedi</i>

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:08.666
<i>and bring forth a new era of Sith rule.</i>

00:02:24.916 --> 00:02:26.875
Greetings. My name is Ethan.

00:02:26.958 --> 00:02:31.208
I'm here because I received
this encoded transmission summoning me.

00:02:33.291 --> 00:02:35.125
The Force is strong here.

00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:41.958
While I am without a master,
I feel the Force within me.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.333
It appears that you
are all masterless Jedi too.

00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:46.833
Is that correct?

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.916
Each of us came here in answer
to the same call, just as you have.

00:03:02.166 --> 00:03:05.166
So then, do we believe this message
to be authentic?

00:03:07.166 --> 00:03:11.208
<i>I call on the Jedi</i>
<i>hidden across the galaxy.</i>

00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:12.916
<i>My name is Juro.</i>

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:17.833
<i>I am the ruler of Hy Izlan,</i>
<i>located in the Outer Rim,</i>

00:03:17.916 --> 00:03:21.458
<i>and I am seeking</i>
<i>to restore the Jedi Order.</i>

00:03:21.541 --> 00:03:23.958
<i>If you have received this message,</i>

00:03:24.041 --> 00:03:28.500
<i>then I invite you</i>
<i>to the Aerial Temple of Hy Izlan.</i>

00:03:28.583 --> 00:03:34.333
<i>There I will present you with</i>
<i>one of the long-lost weapons of the </i>

00:03:34.416 --> 00:03:35.833
<i>a lightsaber.</i>

00:03:35.916 --> 00:03:42.666
<i>Join me in the fight to unite</i>
<i>our war-torn galaxy and restore peace.</i>

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.250
<i>I will be waiting.</i>

00:03:44.916 --> 00:03:49.708
I cannot say if Margrave Juro has actually
been able to recreate lightsabers,

00:03:49.791 --> 00:03:54.500
but it is true that there is a deposit
of kyber crystals on the planet below.

00:03:54.583 --> 00:03:58.041
We too have heard this rumor
of the existence of kyber crystals

00:03:58.125 --> 00:03:59.125
at this location.

00:03:59.958 --> 00:04:01.791
But that is of no concern to us.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:07.250
The real issue is
whether this Juro can be trusted or not.

00:04:15.041 --> 00:04:16.458
He has a point.

00:04:16.541 --> 00:04:21.166
Who's to say if Juro is really
a master Jedi or if this is a trap?

00:04:25.375 --> 00:04:28.416
Is there no one here
who has ever met this Juro before?

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.291
If this is some kind of trap to kill Jedi,

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:38.166
did everyone show up here
believing that they could survive it?

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:41.583
Were you all so confident
that you would not be bested,

00:04:41.666 --> 00:04:45.625
or did you decide it was worth the risk
just to obtain a lightsaber?

00:04:46.708 --> 00:04:49.000
Maybe they think
they're strong enough with the Force

00:04:49.083 --> 00:04:50.833
to be able to protect themselves.

00:04:53.125 --> 00:04:57.083
The Force.
You said that it was strong here,

00:04:57.875 --> 00:05:00.833
but I sense the dark side in this place.

00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:14.916
I see the seven Jedi
have already gathered.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:19.541
Hmm. It is true that the margrave
often frightens others

00:05:19.625 --> 00:05:21.416
because of his appearance,

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.833
but he is just an eccentric old man

00:05:24.916 --> 00:05:27.833
who is not fond
of being cooped up in his castle.

00:05:28.416 --> 00:05:31.083
He does not often appear
in front of others,

00:05:31.166 --> 00:05:34.333
but today is the day
he promised to meet you.

00:05:35.625 --> 00:05:38.625
So I am sure he will arrive soon.

00:06:43.833 --> 00:06:45.041
Hmm.

00:06:55.916 --> 00:06:56.916
I'm back.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:01.125
Father, we found a pretty big one
out there today.

00:07:04.958 --> 00:07:08.583
Did you manage to finish
all those sabers for the margrave?

00:07:08.666 --> 00:07:09.666
Yes.

00:07:11.458 --> 00:07:13.833
-Wow, it's really long.

00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:19.750
Interesting.
So you can change the length on this one?

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.750
Actually, I've tempered
the kyber crystals on each lightsaber

00:07:26.833 --> 00:07:29.708
so it reflects the user's connection
with the Force.

00:07:29.791 --> 00:07:33.166
The color and the length will vary
depending on the Jedi using it.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:36.750
Oh. I guess my connection
to the Force isn't strong enough,

00:07:36.833 --> 00:07:39.000
since the blade doesn't have
any real color.

00:07:39.666 --> 00:07:43.000
Hmm. You do have some natural talent
with a lightsaber, Kara,

00:07:43.083 --> 00:07:46.000
but your connection will grow in time
with proper training.

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:50.166
Remember that while the Force exists
in every living thing,

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.041
only those individuals
who develop their connection to it

00:07:53.125 --> 00:07:54.708
will have the power to wield it.

00:07:55.291 --> 00:07:58.041
But you won't need to worry
about all that quite yet.

00:07:58.125 --> 00:07:59.125
I guess so.

00:07:59.708 --> 00:08:02.083
But I wonder what color
this lightsaber will turn

00:08:02.166 --> 00:08:04.583
when it's finally in the hands
of a real Jedi.

00:08:08.458 --> 00:08:11.458
I kept my promise,
and I actually finished them on time.

00:08:18.125 --> 00:08:19.416
What's wrong, Four-Nines?

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.375
Is that one of the Jedi ships?

00:08:24.875 --> 00:08:28.083
Unlikely, since they were summoned
to the Aerial Temple.

00:08:43.875 --> 00:08:47.208
Kara, I need you to take these
to the temple immediately.

00:08:47.291 --> 00:08:49.958
Oh, wait.
You're not gonna deliver them?

00:08:50.041 --> 00:08:53.416
No. I'll be too busy looking after
our newly arrived visitors.

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:54.500
Oh.

00:08:56.625 --> 00:08:57.708
Hmm?

00:09:00.833 --> 00:09:03.041
You've grown up so much, Kara.

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:07.833
You're all strange, like this is
the last time we'll see each other.

00:09:15.333 --> 00:09:16.166
Kara…

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.583
be careful, and may the Force be with you.

00:09:21.208 --> 00:09:23.083
-Now go.

00:09:28.541 --> 00:09:30.458
Are you the sabersmith Lah Zhima?

00:09:31.166 --> 00:09:32.166
I am.

00:09:32.916 --> 00:09:37.166
You have illicitly manufactured
several lightsabers for masterless Jedi.

00:09:38.208 --> 00:09:40.500
And where exactly did you get that from?

00:09:40.583 --> 00:09:44.083
From the one
who enlisted your services to make them.

00:09:44.166 --> 00:09:45.166
Hmm.

00:09:46.333 --> 00:09:50.041
Lah Zhima, you will hand over
the illegal lightsabers and come with us.

00:09:50.125 --> 00:09:52.541
Oh, yeah?
And what happens if I refuse?

00:09:52.625 --> 00:09:55.041
Refusal is not an option.

00:10:03.333 --> 00:10:04.708
Father, no!

00:10:06.541 --> 00:10:07.791
Kara, just go!

00:10:07.875 --> 00:10:08.875
Silence!

00:10:11.125 --> 00:10:12.125
Follow her!

00:10:21.541 --> 00:10:23.291
If we are to believe these claims,

00:10:23.375 --> 00:10:26.458
the margrave is gathering
all the Jedi in the galaxy,

00:10:26.541 --> 00:10:29.291
all as part of an effort
to try to end the war.

00:10:29.791 --> 00:10:32.458
I would like to see evidence of this
before he arrives.

00:10:33.875 --> 00:10:35.541
Evidence?

00:10:36.416 --> 00:10:40.041
Yes. Did the margrave
actually construct any lightsabers?

00:10:41.666 --> 00:10:43.666
Is this what you desire?

00:10:54.625 --> 00:10:56.208
May I please hold it?

00:10:56.291 --> 00:11:00.250
By the time I was born, lightsabers
were already lost from the galaxy.

00:11:05.625 --> 00:11:08.666
A lightsaber. A real lightsaber.

00:11:19.208 --> 00:11:23.333
The remaining sabers
should be arriving very shortly.

00:12:07.958 --> 00:12:10.625
The Force is strong in this child.

00:13:08.208 --> 00:13:10.333
Old droid!

00:13:12.083 --> 00:13:16.333
Please. I need for you to take us
to the Aerial Temple immediately!

00:13:24.416 --> 00:13:29.375
I'm on my break.

00:13:29.875 --> 00:13:32.625
-Find another pilot.

00:13:36.791 --> 00:13:41.625
Well, it's gotta be you, since it seems
you're the only one functioning.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:47.000
Please. I don't have any time.
Just take this and get me to the temple.

00:13:47.625 --> 00:13:51.875
I might as well.

00:13:52.416 --> 00:13:54.416
Come on, then.

00:14:04.916 --> 00:14:07.166
Just hurry up!

00:14:11.083 --> 00:14:13.666
Just how long are we expected
to wait here?

00:14:21.666 --> 00:14:24.583
-Something's coming.
-Do you think it's the margrave's ship?

00:14:38.083 --> 00:14:39.333
Father.

00:14:51.083 --> 00:14:53.458
-Thank you, old droid.
-Don't mention it.

00:14:56.708 --> 00:14:58.083
Are you…

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.916
I'm-- My name is Kara.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.375
I'm the daughter
of the sabersmith Lah Zhima.

00:15:04.666 --> 00:15:06.333
The sabersmith?

00:15:06.416 --> 00:15:08.750
So you're the one
with the lightsabers then.

00:15:09.333 --> 00:15:12.958
Yes. But my father was caught
and taken away by the Jedi Hunters.

00:15:14.958 --> 00:15:17.291
Please, use these to help me save him!

00:15:23.791 --> 00:15:27.416
But where is the margrave? Is he not here?

00:15:28.083 --> 00:15:29.791
Hold on. Do you know the margrave?

00:15:29.875 --> 00:15:32.500
Yeah.
I've known him ever since I was a baby.

00:15:35.291 --> 00:15:40.458
Hmm. So then, does that mean you might
possibly know where he could be right now?

00:15:43.375 --> 00:15:46.500
Something doesn't feel right.
I don't think we have a choice.

00:15:46.583 --> 00:15:48.916
We'll have to wait
for the margrave to arrive.

00:15:54.291 --> 00:15:56.333
That color…

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:59.541
No, no, no. You're all…

00:16:01.041 --> 00:16:02.541
-I see.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:14.958
Your wait is over.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:21.250
I have been here the entire time.

00:16:21.333 --> 00:16:22.750
It's the margrave!

00:16:23.375 --> 00:16:24.833
How pathetic, Juro.

00:16:24.916 --> 00:16:27.708
You would disguise yourself
as a droid to spy on us?

00:16:27.791 --> 00:16:31.083
We are acolytes of the Sith
and sworn to the dark side.

00:16:31.166 --> 00:16:36.208
And we are here to put an end to your
pitiful plans of restoring the Jedi Order.

00:16:37.166 --> 00:16:38.666
Now die, Juro!

00:16:47.875 --> 00:16:48.791
Hanbei!

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:58.833
Our hunters have taken your father
to a distant star system

00:16:58.916 --> 00:17:00.833
where you'll never see him again.

00:17:00.916 --> 00:17:03.333
And any attempt to rescue him
will result in failure.

00:17:18.416 --> 00:17:20.458
Nice moves.

00:17:37.958 --> 00:17:39.333
Roden!

00:17:43.041 --> 00:17:44.500
Die!

00:17:58.083 --> 00:17:59.500
Niizo.

00:18:07.875 --> 00:18:10.625
Just who are you?

00:18:11.833 --> 00:18:14.041
You will suffer, Juro!

00:18:31.375 --> 00:18:33.458
Oh, no! Help the margrave!

00:18:55.666 --> 00:18:57.875
Juro!

00:19:13.125 --> 00:19:14.291
That's enough!

00:19:14.916 --> 00:19:17.000
We both know this isn't you, Homen.

00:19:21.458 --> 00:19:24.958
I apologize.
I became consumed by the others' darkness.

00:19:30.041 --> 00:19:31.791
I'm so sorry, Kara.

00:19:31.875 --> 00:19:35.458
I recently learned that a number of Jedi
who answered my call were killed

00:19:35.541 --> 00:19:37.500
and Sith were sent in their place.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:41.916
So I hid myself in their presence
in order to determine who was Sith,

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:44.541
but because of that,
they learned about your father,

00:19:44.625 --> 00:19:46.541
and I could not be there to help.

00:19:46.625 --> 00:19:48.166
Will you help me save him?

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.375
Of course I will, my child.

00:19:50.458 --> 00:19:51.833
Margrave Juro.

00:19:51.916 --> 00:19:54.375
You summoned me all the way out here,
but in the end,

00:19:54.458 --> 00:19:57.208
I'm afraid I was not strong enough
to defeat them.

00:19:57.291 --> 00:20:00.833
Don't worry.
You survived the fight, young Ethan.

00:20:00.916 --> 00:20:02.791
But then, what about the other Jedi?

00:20:02.875 --> 00:20:05.958
I sense them. They are not lost.

00:20:06.041 --> 00:20:09.458
They are still wandering out there,
somewhere in the galaxy.

00:20:15.416 --> 00:20:20.541
Kara, you have been guided by the Force
ever since the moment you were born.

00:20:20.625 --> 00:20:22.041
Come and follow me.

00:20:22.125 --> 00:20:25.875
Help us restore peace to the galaxy
and take your place as the ninth Jedi

00:20:25.958 --> 00:20:28.208
so we can reestablish the Jedi Order.
